    "DeleteSectionOperation": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Remove a section with no children, no facsimile page and no\ncanonical_locus.\n\nA section with text is refused unless `delete_texts` is set; then every\ntext of the section, in every language and version, is deleted with it.\n`expected_text_ids` names the section's current texts, one per language,\nso approval refuses if a version or language was added since. The batch\nis the record of what was deleted.",
